# AGP's default optimized Android rules preserve classes/method names for native
# entrypoints (LlamaRunner, DiffusionRunner and NativeArtifactFs). The llama and
# diffusion modules additionally publish their JNI field/enum/constructor rules.
#
# ONNX Runtime 1.31.0 only bundles telemetry keep rules in its AAR. Native code
# also constructs and inspects Java wrappers. Use the upstream consumer rule:
# https://onnxruntime.ai/docs/build/android.html
-keep class ai.onnxruntime.** { *; }
